 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big big hero and Ophelia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big hero and Ophelia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big hero and Ophelia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Ophelia.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Act II: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
